Wed Oct 14 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- %pre: %systemd_user_pre for the user units. Without it openSUSE never
  applies the user presets, so nazoos-session-failed.service stayed
  disabled and the "gaming mode could not start" notification never
  showed up (fresh installs of the package; the image build also
  presets it in config.sh)

